WEBVTT

00:00:01.117 --> 00:00:03.986
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Have you brought anything from a chain store recently?

00:00:04.394 --> 00:00:05.526
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Yes, I have.

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:07.715
I went to H&amp;M three weeks ago.

00:00:07.828 --> 00:00:09.127
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> And what did you buy?

00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:10.710
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> I bought a skirt.